\item[S2] Mikhail Lyubich, ``Measure and Dimension of Julia Sets'', in Ben Bielefeld and Mikhail Lyubich (eds.), Problems in Holomorphic Dynamics (1992), Problem 6, pp. 27; arXiv:math/9205209v1. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/math/9205209}.
